        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yethiro wendo ri Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yethiro or Musa, aka jacway ri Were i wi migam ma Midian owinjo kwoŋ gima Were oyido otimo ri Musa kodi Joisiraili munyo otelo jo wok i Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Yethiro obino, aka okelo cipa Musa m'oyido owey cen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi wot Musa ario, Gerison ma nyinge nyutho ni oyido abedo jawoth i piny pa jopath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka man oyido ilwoŋo ni Elieza kole owaco ni, “Were pa baba okonyan to bothan, kwoŋ abor pa Farawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yethiro obino gi cipa Musa gi wote ario i thim kama Musa oyido oketh'iye kambi i got maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yethiro oyido odhiro rigo wac nike jobino, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ameno Musa owok romo gi go, okule piny, aka ocwiyo lembe. Jopenjere kwoŋ kwo pajo to jodonjo i wema pa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa owaco ri Yethiro kisi gima Rwoth otimo ri Farawo gi Jomisir ŋey wobothi Joisiraili. Go bende owaco ri Yethiro kwoŋ dinyo ma ji joneno i yo kodi nger ma Rwoth obotho iye jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yethiro owinjo gime je, osangala ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka owaco ni, “Rwoth wopak m'obotho win wok i cingi Farawo gi Jomisir. Rwoth wopak m'obotho ji pere bedo ŋecin! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo pama aŋeyo nike Rwoth dwoŋ loyo werin je, kwoŋbedo obotho ji pere wok i cingi Jomisir munyo oyido jotero jo gi cay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yethiro omiyo mic awaŋa gi cowirok man ri Were, aka Aron obino gi jotel pa Joisiraili je to jocamo mugat kanyacel gi or Musa ruwaŋ Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa ketho jothum banja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere Musa oyido winjo banjin i dier ji, aka obedo gi tic wok odikin kiri wor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yethiro oneno kisi gima Musa oyido timo ri ji, openjo ni, “Me je ginaŋo m'itimo ri ji? Raŋo itimo gime je kendin, gi ji cungo ka wok odikin tundo othieno?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa odwoko ni, “Kwoŋbedo ji jobino bongan ŋeyo mito pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka j'ario jonitie gi dhaw, jobino bongan t'awaco ŋat'otire, aka bende awaco rijo or gi cik pa Were.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yethiro owaco ri Musa ni, “Gim'itimo kiber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In kiri gi ji je wibino ol. Gime dit rin timo kendin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo winjan, abino miyin rieko aka Were bino bedo kodin. Otire rin pido ri ji ruwaŋ Were t'ikelo dhaw pajo rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iripo fonjo jo or pa Were kodi tito rijo nger ma joripo woth'iye, kodi gima joripo timo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To medo i wi meno, iripo yero cwo ma jonitie gi nyalo, ma jolworo Were, ma jogenere, aka jokijol nyew. Ikethi jo telo ji i kitipa ma ganin, miya, piero abic, kodi apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi jowothum banja kisi hongo. Banjin matek mere jowokeli rin, aka mathindho mere jowothum. Meno bino loko rin tic mayot, ka bende jotiŋo bieto me kodin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'itimo gime, paka Were wodho or, in won ikibino ol, aka ji me je jonyalo dok munyo dhaw pajo okwey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
